1
00:00:01,020 --> 00:00:08,000
Fishing Village Scenery Across Seasons

2
00:00:09,160 --> 00:00:21,030
Winter, countryside is all yellow, many different shades of yellow.

3
00:00:22,930 --> 00:00:29,760
Pale sunshine is yellow hoe color.

4
00:00:31,060 --> 00:00:40,630
In garden, clusters of golden yellow papaya hang.

5
00:00:42,360 --> 00:00:47,760
Each jackfruit leaf is bright yellow.

6
00:00:49,060 --> 00:00:58,030
Cassava leaves, cassava leaf open bright yellow wings.

7
00:00:59,200 --> 00:01:07,130
Banana flower cluster has ripe yellow fruit.

8
00:01:08,600 --> 00:01:17,030
Yellow banana leaves fall like coat tails, shirt tails...

9
00:01:18,160 --> 00:01:25,000
Under yard, dry rice straw and paddy are crispy yellow.

10
00:01:26,030 --> 00:01:32,900
Around, chickens and dogs are smooth yellow.

11
00:01:33,960 --> 00:01:40,160
Beyond crevice, a few bright red chilies pop out.

12
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:49,230
All are dyed a rich, warm, strange yellow.

